---
import MarketingLayout from "../layouts/MarketingLayout.astro";
import { urls } from "../lib/urls";
---
<MarketingLayout
  title="Deployment & Rollout Process"
  description="How a Vyfoo rollout typically works, from discovery through pilot and multi-outlet rollout. Timeline depends on complexity, outlet count, and readiness."
  path="/deployment"
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container prose">
      <p class="breadcrumbs"><a href="/">Home</a> / Deployment</p>
      <h1>How a deployment typically works</h1>
      <p>
        Implementation timeline depends on migration scope, hardware readiness, data quality, integrations, and
        training requirements — we don't promise every deployment completes on a fixed schedule.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section section--cream">
    <div class="container">
      <ol class="deploy-steps">
        <li><strong>Discovery & requirements</strong><span>Understand your outlets, hardware, menu structure, and integration needs.</span></li>
        <li><strong>Data & menu preparation</strong><span>Prepare menu data, recipes, pricing, and tax configuration.</span></li>
        <li><strong>Configuration & hardware validation</strong><span>Configure the system and confirm it runs correctly on your chosen hardware.</span></li>
        <li><strong>Staff training & pilot</strong><span>Train staff and run a pilot at one outlet before wider rollout.</span></li>
        <li><strong>Rollout & operational review</strong><span>Roll out to remaining outlets and review performance against your goals.</span></li>
      </ol>
      <p class="caveat-note">A proposed scoped rollout (for example, a fast multi-store switchover) is an example implementation pathway, not an unconditional service guarantee — actual timing depends on the factors above.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section section--ink">
    <div class="container cta-split">
      <div><h2>Scope your rollout with us</h2></div>
      <a class="btn btn--on-ink btn--lg" href={urls.bookDemo}>Book Enterprise Demo</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</MarketingLayout>
<style>
  .deploy-steps { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-4); max-width: var(--container-narrow); }
  .deploy-steps li { background: var(--color-paper); border: 1px solid var(--color-line); border-radius: var(--radius-md); padding: var(--space-5); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-1); }
  .cta-split { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-6); }
  .cta-split h2 { margin: 0; }
</style>
